  "description": "C# Excel Library for Barcode is a .NET barcode generator, reader library on Excel document from KeepDynamic.\n\nBarcode on Excel SDK can be easily integrated and used in C#, VB.NET, ASP.NET Core, Framework, MVC, WinForms, WPF, console and desktop applications.\n\nSupported barcode formats :\n* QR Code (Styled QR Code, GS1 QR Code, Macro, Micro QR Code), \n* Data Matrix (GS1, Structure Append) and PDF-417 (Micro included)\n* Code 39, Code 128, GS1-128\n* EAN 8, EAN 13, UPC-A, UPC-E, +2, +5\n* Interleaved 2 of 5, ITF-14\n* And more\n\nCompatible with :\n* .NET Standard 2.0\n* .NET 8, .NET 7, .NET 6, .NET 5\n* .NET Core 3.x, & 2.x\n* .NET Framework 4.6.1\n\nDocuments\n* How to : http://www.keepdynamic.com/barcoding/csharp-barcode-generator.shtml\n* Email : support@keepdynamic.com",
